# lantern-counter.trk -- a 7-note phrase, one row per bar-quintuplet (5 rows/bar).
# Seven rows against five per bar: it realigns every 7 bars. Values are scale
# DEGREES (quant.degree), stepped through the current chord's mask, so the
# phrase re-harmonizes itself under every chord.

track ctr note cva          # 1: strike | degree

pattern ctr 7
0 | x 0
1 | x 2
2 | .
3 | x 1
4 | x 3
5 | .
6 | x -1

order |: ctr
